<title>JAPAN: Tostem Viva -irregular six-mth forecast.</title>
<headline>Tostem Viva -irregular six-mth forecast.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to August 31, 1997</p>
<p>		   (in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p>			  6-MONTH	  ACTUAL FULL YEAR</p>
<p> (Parent)	     FORECAST	 TO FEB 97</p>
<p> Sales		 54.00	     101.60</p>
